<article class="env-lemma" id="0AYZ">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/0AYZ">Lemma <span data-tag="0AYZ">33.44.11</span>.</a> Let $k$ be a field. Let $f : X \to Y$ be a nonconstant morphism of proper curves over $k$. Let $\mathcal{E}$ be a locally free $\mathcal{O}_ Y$-module. Then </p>
  <div class="equation">
  \[  \deg (f^*\mathcal{E}) = \deg (X/Y) \deg (\mathcal{E})  \]
</div>
</article><article class="env-proof">
    <p>
      <strong>Proof.</strong>
      The degree of $X$ over $Y$ is defined in Morphisms, Definition <a href="/tag/02NY" data-tag="02NY">29.52.8</a>. Thus $f_*\mathcal{O}_ X$ is a coherent $\mathcal{O}_ Y$-module of rank $\deg (X/Y)$, i.e., $\deg (X/Y) = \dim _{\kappa (\xi )} (f_*\mathcal{O}_ X)_\xi $ where $\xi $ is the generic point of $Y$. Thus we obtain 
    <p>
      <div class="equation">
  \begin{align*}  \chi (X, f^*\mathcal{E}) &  = \chi (Y, f_*f^*\mathcal{E}) \\ &  = \chi (Y, \mathcal{E} \otimes f_*\mathcal{O}_ X) \\ &  = \deg (X/Y) \deg (\mathcal{E}) + n \chi (Y, f_*\mathcal{O}_ X) \\ &  = \deg (X/Y) \deg (\mathcal{E}) + n \chi (X, \mathcal{O}_ X) \end{align*}
</div>
    <p>
       as desired. The first equality as $f$ is finite, see Cohomology of Schemes, Lemma <a href="/tag/089W" data-tag="089W">30.2.4</a>. The second equality by projection formula, see Cohomology, Lemma <a href="/tag/01E8" data-tag="01E8">20.54.2</a>. The third equality by Lemma <a href="/tag/0AYV" data-tag="0AYV">33.44.5</a>. 
      <span class="qed">$\square$</span>
    </p>
</article>